      "body": "## Motivation\n\nThe DSV4/DSV32 tool serializer adds `strict: false` when the request omits `strict`. The checkpoint reference encoder preserves that omission, so the injected tool payload differs from the request.\n\n## Modifications\n\nSerialize injected DSV4/DSV32 tools with `exclude_unset=True` and `by_alias=True`, matching the Kimi K3 injection sites. Preserve the separate DeepSeek-V4.1 serializer. Add a regression comparing the injected tool dictionary with the request.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n147 CPU tests and 90 subtests passed in the OpenAI serving-chat suite, including the DSV4 tool-payload regression. Live DeepSeek prompt comparisons have not been rerun.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNo speed benchmark was run.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format changed code.\n- [x] Run regression tests described above.\n\n## Review and Merge Process\n\n1. Ping Merge Oncalls to start the process. See the [PR Merge Process](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.github/MAINTAINER.md#pull-request-merge-process).\n2. Get approvals from [CODEOWNERS](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.github/CODEOWNERS) and other reviewers.\n3. Trigger CI tests with [comments](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#how-to-trigger-ci-tests) or contact authorized users to do so.\n   - Common commands include `/tag-and-rerun-ci`, `/tag-run-ci-label`, `/rerun-failed-ci`\n4. After green CI and required approvals, ask Merge Oncalls or people with Write permission to merge the PR.\n\nDeveloped with AI assistance.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37577724934](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37577724934)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37577724756](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37577724756)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37577724890](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37577724890)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\n",
